From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bumba <noreply@bumba>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 19:21:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Isolate embedded make scheduling and reuse recipe workers

Move execution flags and inherited job counts into each evaluator, read logical MAKEFLAGS rather than process globals, and replace one large-stack thread per target with a bounded per-invocation worker pool.

